{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Propeller Hat is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be ",["l","裁缝","tailored"]," using ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," and a ",["l","矿工特供","Miner's Treat"]," at the sewing machine inside ",["l","柳巷2号","Emily's house"]," or the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," received as a reward for the ",["l","任务","\"Rock Rejuvenation\""]," special order. It can also be obtained from ",["l","沙漠节","Emily's outfit services"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". There is a ≈2% chance to receive the gender-neutral outfit with the Propeller Hat."]],["p",["There is a small chance to receive this hat from slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"],", breaking ",["l","矿井","crates and barrels"],", chopping ",["l","树","trees"],", shaking trees with seeds, digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s, or by ",["l","淘盘","panning"],"."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The Propeller Hat outfit also includes the ",["f","Shirt192.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Jester Shirt"]," and ",["f","Farmer_Pants.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Farmer Pants"]," (dyed RGB value 2,184,224)."]]]]]]]}